               given ratio. The ratio is limited to ]0.0 .. 1.0]. In case of
               <= 0.0 it will be reset to the default ratio. The default
               vertical/horizontal ratio is 0.33/0.5.
       
               .. seealso::
       
                   :py:meth:`legendRatio()`
               """
               self.setLegendPosition(self.legendPosition(), ratio)
       
